window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I never knew magic existed—until a witch put a curse on me. Now I’ve got the powers of four fae men inside me.</b><br> <br> It was supposed to be an ordinary evening out with my boyfriend, trying to revive the spark in our floundering relationship. But when a witch attacks us out of nowhere and my now <i>ex-</i>boyfriend runs for the hills instead of trying to help, my world is turned upside down.<br> <br> It’s not my ex running away that’s the shocker. Honestly, I should’ve seen that coming.<br> <br> What throws my entire life into chaos is the fact that magic is <i>real</i>…and I’ve somehow stolen the powers of four gorgeous, terrifying men.<br> <br> Turns out, the four of them are shadow fae, a group of warriors who are duty bound to protect the barrier between the fae and human realms. They’re on a mission, chasing a dangerous wizard hell bent on tearing the veil to shreds.<br> <br> And I just became their only hope of completing that mission.<br> <br> But as they train me to use their magic and we face dangers I never could’ve imagined, the lines between us start to blur. I feel a pull toward these men that’s impossible to resist…and I’m not sure I want to.<br> <br> The fate of our worlds might not the only thing on the line anymore.<br> <br> Maybe my heart is too.</p> <p><i>NOTE: This is a standalone paranormal romance where the heroine doesn't have to choose between her four delicious fae men. There is no cliffhanger, and it has a HEA!</i></p>"; 
